# Surface files

Design and product authority is `DESIGN.md` and `PRODUCT.md`. Tokens live in
`src/app/globals.css`; derive from the existing variables rather than introducing a parallel
palette.

- **Locales.** New copy ships in `messages/en.json`, `messages/ru.json` and `messages/kk.json`
  together, at identical key set and ordering. Locale codes are `kk` | `ru` | `en`. Never render a
  canonical internal English record directly to a user; select a localized message and fail closed.
- **Accessibility.** Localized alt text on meaningful imagery, empty `alt` on decorative. Visible
  focus on every interactive element. Status is never colour alone.
- **Motion.** CSS only. No `transition: all`. Honour `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce`.
- **Components.** Reuse `@/components/ui/*` and the existing shared and surface primitives. Do not
  fork a second button, table or layout system, and do not add a parallel UI tree.
- **Responsive.** Wide content scrolls inside its own container; the page body never scrolls
  horizontally. Prefer `next/image`.
